	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n5NzN1PXcWXdMyUxx",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 12, DX 12, IQ 3, HT 12, HP 12, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nMxiC_jzJIp6ygq_z",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 24 (offense 20, protection 4), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nuhVQkdaYkrYnBz7l",
			"text": "Constrict: Constrict: Reach C. Once it has hold, the coils go on. No attack roll and no defence: win a Quick Contest of ST each second or take crushing damage and lose the breath to shout with."
		},
		{
			"id": "nTczK58IHgqKiuJXn",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/constrictor-snake.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nRTphQ6hDaMAZGt_T",
			"text": "Independent build total: -22 points of racial traits plus 20 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nduXIe96Q09snsyrs",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Constrictor Snake (SRD 5.1); Constrictor Snake (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "niwLHUT2s6fxlR9jb",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "neGuOnwrBv1hpJgjg",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 30 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbfzCv2-l8_CmmttP",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary); water Move 6. The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "naXGHRC95N5zyCudB",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nfmskzGH4Jk1pBJ0Q",
			"text": "Three metres, which is the SM +1 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "n846VOKBh57eEL2Vb",
			"text": "ST from Basic Lift: the coils have to beat a struggling animal of its own mass, which is what constriction is."
		},
		{
			"id": "nTLUoUY5kTQBltgSr",
			"text": "The coils are priced by binding ST rather than by damage, because they do their work by holding rather than by wounding."
		},
		{
			"id": "nsqsk3DDn_VEnnUSR",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Double Jointed; the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_fTU-zZ2uMHK85Q8",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
